@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081

### 注意
### 本文件保留同步下单关系校验的历史调试场景；阶段 4B 后，高并发主链路只走 /api/orders/async。
@userId = 1
@showId = 1
@sessionId = 1
@ticketCategoryId = 2
@token = idem_替换为关系校验测试token

### 1. 获取幂等 token
### 执行后复制 data.token 到 @token。
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/idempotency-token?userId={{userId}}

### 2. 错误 showId + 正确 sessionId + ticketCategoryId，应返回：演出、场次或票档关系不匹配
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": {{userId}},
  "showId": 999,
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": 1,
  "idempotencyToken": "{{token}}"
}

### 3. 正确 showId + 错误 sessionId + 正确 ticketCategoryId，应返回：演出、场次或票档关系不匹配
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": {{userId}},
  "showId": {{showId}},
  "sessionId": 999,
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": 1,
  "idempotencyToken": "{{token}}"
}

### 4. 正确 showId + sessionId + 错误 ticketCategoryId，应返回：演出、场次或票档关系不匹配
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": {{userId}},
  "showId": {{showId}},
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": 999,
  "quantity": 1,
  "idempotencyToken": "{{token}}"
}

### 5. 正确 showId + sessionId + ticketCategoryId，应成功创建订单
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": {{userId}},
  "showId": {{showId}},
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": 1,
  "idempotencyToken": "{{token}}"
}

### 6. 异步下单关系校验：错误 showId，应返回：演出、场次或票档关系不匹配
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/async
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": {{userId}},
  "showId": 999,
  "sessionId": {{sessionId}},
  "ticketCategoryId": {{ticketCategoryId}},
  "quantity": 1,
  "idempotencyToken": "{{token}}"
}
